OL,5,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIn France, eccentric royalist Tony
OL,7,     Fand his Armenian wife Shou Shou
OL,8,     Fprovide an unusual mix of vinegar
OL,9,     Ftasting and royal regalia at Le
OL,10,     FManoir in the Dordogne.
OL,11,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FIn France, Shaun and his partner
OL,13,     FPatrick host at Le Clos Rabelais.
OL,14,     FThere are high kicks, low blows
OL,15,     Fand some unfavourable feedback.
OL,16,G1550 Four in a Bed
